DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260215T110000
SUMMARY:Lovestruck on bike
LOCATION:Lovestruck Books & Cafe\, 44 Brattle St\, Cambridge\, MA 02138
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to cry your heart out\, stay delusional\, and confess
  your feelings during our Valentines Day Weekend ride!!\n\nProjected to be
  40 degrees out\, so a beautiful day to get out and bring a loved one (par
 tner/friend/family/pet) on a main character bike ride through Boston along
  the Charles\, into Cambridge’s romance-themed bookstore: Lovestruck Boo
 ks and Cafe!!\n\nFREE BLUEBIKE codes will be provided!! Bring a friend who
  doesn’t have a bike\n\nLovestruck has a George Howell cafe so well be b
 ook perusing\, making friends\, and enjoying their coffee & treats there :
 )\n\nRSVP: https://partiful.com/e/zNzLp290WKRSyUhpwGfI
URL:https://partiful.com/e/zNzLp290WKRSyUhpwGfI
END:VEVENT
