BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:LOUbCIwmaCIoFwgW9hmy
DTSTAMP:20261024T151908Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260502T170000
SUMMARY:Jimmy’s Café: Spring 2026
LOCATION:65 Concord Ave Backyard\, Somerville\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Happy 1-year anniversary to Jimmy's Café🩵\n\nWe have an ext
 ra special pop-up planned for May 2nd to celebrate the growth of what star
 ted as our little backyard home cafe🥰\n\nWe are so grateful for everyon
 e's support and appreciation of the unique flavors and vibrant cultures we
  highlight in our menu - a passion that Jimmy and I share with all of you!
 \n\nBecause of this and the incredible contributions that Japanese influen
 ce has on cafe culture\, and its distinctly nostalgic flavors\, we decided
  to theme this year's spring menu:\n\n「ジミーの春」\n\n"Jimmy no H
 aru" or "Jimmy's Spring" is a take on the nostalgic Japanese film Kikujir
 ō no Natsu\, accompanied by the song Summer by Joe Hisaishi\n\nIn additio
 n\, we are collaborating with some folks in the community to bring extra s
 pecial pastries from Phinista Cafe👀\, a signature banger of a drink cre
 ated with @samatchalee\, and coordinating a special ride with Boston Cafe 
 Bikers by opening our space to be inclusive to the biking community!\n\nAs
  always\, we can't wait to see you there🫶\n\nRSVP: https://partiful.com
 /e/LOUbCIwmaCIoFwgW9hmy
URL:https://partiful.com/e/LOUbCIwmaCIoFwgW9hmy
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
