 om Phinista Cafe\, which has locations around the Boston area.\n🌸 🌸
 🌸 🌸 🌸🌸 🌸 🌸🌸 🌸 🌸🌸 🌸 🌸\nCome on a ride t
 o my friend’s backyard cafe pop-up with the most beautiful drinks\, enjo
 y the weather\, and meet new folks :) we’ll have two rides\, both starti
 ng at 11 AM at the Boston Common: a 30 minute and an hour long ride\, your
  choice\n\nRSVP: https://partiful.com/e/QzhYTz9dn7KeTOWRLjyc
URL:https://partiful.com/e/QzhYTz9dn7KeTOWRLjyc
END:VEVENT
