SUMMARY:Tour de Streets
LOCATION:Livable Streets Alliance\, 100 Sidney St\, Cambridge\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Tour de Streets!\nTour de Streets is an annual fund
 raising event\, featuring a walk\, bike ride\, and a celebration with free
  food\, drinks\, + activities provided by local vendors!\n\nTo ride with B
 oston Cafe Bikers you must be registered (it’s free!) so use the link ab
 ove to sign up\n\nThe bike ride is 2 hours long\, ~12 miles starting at 10
 :30. A leisurely ride for people of all abilities. Includes riding on new 
 bicycle infrastructure around Boston and Cambridge.\n\nDate: Saturday Octo
 ber 24  10 AM - 2:30 PM\nLocation: LivableStreets Office\, 100 Sidney Stre
 et\, Cambridge 02139 (near Central Square).\n\nThis is a great opportunity
  to connect with partners and friends as we celebrate LivableStreets’ ac
 complishments and ensure we have the resources to fund our work in the com
 ing years.\n\nRSVP: https://partiful.com/e/kJ7dHkHGj3ZXSU8IfUHD
